{# Decision template: 1-step evaluation for JoinOngoingSex.
   Evaluates whether current participants accept the joiner, whether the group intent shifts,
   and the main/secondary role combination for all participants. #}
{% set ostimNetSettings = ostimnet_settings(player.UUID) %}
{% set enableAggressiveIntent = ostimNetSettings.enableAggressiveIntent %}

[ state participants ]
    ### {{ decnpc(joiner).name }} (wants to join)
    {{ render_character_profile("tton_gm", joiner) }}
    ---
    {% for actor in currentActors %}
        ### {{ decnpc(actor).name }} (currently in scene)
        {% if actor == player.UUID %}
            **Player rule:** Don't evaluate {{ player.name }}'s willingness. Assume the player is always willing to accept joining.
        {% else %}
            {{ render_character_profile("tton_gm", actor) }}
        {% endif %}
        ---
    {% endfor %}
[ end state ]

[ state recent_events ]
    {{ render_template("helpers\\ostimnet_recent_events") }}
[ end state ]

[ state ongoing_scene ]
    A `{{ currentIntent }}` sexual scene involving {{ currentActorNames }} is currently underway.
    {% if sceneDescription != "" %}Current Animation: {{ sceneDescription }}{% endif %}
    **{{ joinerName }}** wants to join the scene.
    {% if reason != "" %}Why the roleplaying AI decided {{ joinerName }} should join the scene: {{ reason }}{% endif %}

    ### Acceptance Rules for `{{ currentIntent }}`
    {{ joinerName }} has already decided to join. Evaluate whether the **current participants** would accept them:

    {% if currentIntent == "romantic" %}
        Acceptance requires ALL of the following from the current participants:
        - No current participant has hostility, disgust, or strong discomfort toward {{ joinerName }}
        - At least one current participant has a positive motivation to include {{ joinerName }}: attraction, emotional investment, or genuine desire for their presence
        - No dealbreakers: exclusive commitment that would be violated by adding {{ joinerName }}
        - "No objection" is not sufficient — at least one participant must actively want {{ joinerName }} there
    {% elif currentIntent == "lustful" %}
        Acceptance requires ALL of the following from the current participants:
        - No current participant has hostility or disgust toward {{ joinerName }} (mild dislike is acceptable if overridden by physical interest)
        - The current participants would welcome or at least not meaningfully resist {{ joinerName }} joining
        - No dealbreakers: exclusive emotional commitments that adding {{ joinerName }} would violate
    {% elif currentIntent == "transactional" %}
        Acceptance requires:
        - The current participants would accept {{ joinerName }} in the available role (provider or recipient)
        - The modified arrangement still makes material sense to all parties
        - No active hostility that would override the material dynamic
    {% elif currentIntent == "dom" %}
        Acceptance requires ALL of the following:
        - The current participants would accept {{ joinerName }} into their established dynamic in a specific role
        - There is sufficient trust or an established relationship to include a new participant — absence of objection is not enough
    {% elif currentIntent == "aggressive" %}
        {% if enableAggressiveIntent %}
            Acceptance is evaluated asymmetrically:
            - **As additional aggressor:** Current aggressors must be willing to include {{ joinerName }} and {{ joinerName }} must be capable of assisting in overpowering the victim(s)
            - **As additional victim:** You don't have to evaluate willingness — the victim's lack of consent is what defines the aggressive intent.
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

    ### Role Definitions per Intent
    {{ render_template("ostimnet_intents\\ostimnet_intents_roles_all") }}
[ end state ]

[ question accept noul ]
    {{ joinerName }} wants to join the ongoing `{{ currentIntent }}` sexual scene with {{ currentActorNames }}.
    Evaluate whether the current participants ({{ currentActorNames }}) accept {{ joinerName }} joining based on the Acceptance Rules in `ongoing_scene`, `participants`, and `recent_events`.
    [ criteria ]
        true: The current participants ({{ currentActorNames }}) accept {{ joinerName }} joining the scene
        false: The current participants ({{ currentActorNames }}) refuse and do not accept {{ joinerName }} joining the scene
    [ end criteria ]
[ end question ]

[ question intent choice ]
    The current intent is `{{ currentIntent }}`, set for the original participants. If {{ joinerName }} joins, determine whether the intent stays `{{ currentIntent }}` or updates for the full group ({{ currentActorNames }} + {{ joinerName }}) based on `participants` and `recent_events`:
    - **romantic -> lustful:** Downgrade if {{ joinerName }} has no romantic feelings toward any current participant and the current participants have no romantic feelings toward {{ joinerName }}.
    - **lustful -> romantic:** Upgrade only if {{ joinerName }} has a deep romantic connection to all current participants and all current participants reciprocate romantically. Very rare.
    - **lustful / romantic -> transactional:** Only if a material exchange (payment, favor, leverage) is now the primary driver for at least one participant's involvement and this reframes the whole encounter.
    - **transactional -> lustful:** Only if the material component becomes irrelevant with the new participant and mutual physical desire takes over.
    - **dom -> other:** Only if the dominant/submissive structure can no longer hold with the new group composition.
    - **aggressive -> other:** Do not change.
    - **other -> aggressive:** Do not set.
    If none of the above clearly apply, keep `{{ currentIntent }}`.
    [ criteria ]
        romantic: {{ render_template("ostimnet_intents_definitions\\ostimnet_intent_romantic_description_short") }}
        lustful: {{ render_template("ostimnet_intents_definitions\\ostimnet_intent_lustful_description_short") }}
        transactional: {{ render_template("ostimnet_intents_definitions\\ostimnet_intent_transactional_description_short") }}
        dom: {{ render_template("ostimnet_intents_definitions\\ostimnet_intent_dom_description_short") }}
        {% if enableAggressiveIntent -%}
            aggressive: {{ render_template("ostimnet_intents_definitions\\ostimnet_intent_aggressive_description_short") }}
        {%- endif %}
    [ end criteria ]
[ end question ]

[ question roles choice ]
    If {{ joinerName }} joins the scene, choose the `main` and `secondary` role combination for all participants ({{ currentActorNames }} + {{ joinerName }}) based on `ongoing_scene`, `participants`, and `recent_events`.
    [ criteria ]
        {% for combo in roleCombinations -%}
            {{ combo.key }}: main: {{ combo.mainNames }}; secondary: {{ combo.secondaryNames }}
        {% endfor -%}
    [ end criteria ]
[ end question ]
